# -- Not published ------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is public. Everything below stays on the build machine.

# The Fluent 2 design capture the skin was drawn from. It is a capture of
# Microsoft's design surface, not our work, and this repository's license grants
# unlimited commercial use — which is not ours to grant over someone else's
# material. The skin it produced is original and stays; the source does not.
Roundcube Fluent 2 Theme.dc.html
Roundcube Fluent 2 Theme Design.zip

# The JetHost brand kit as delivered: two 58MB brandbook PDFs and the full RGB
# logo set. The six derived SVGs under skins/businessclass/images/ ARE published,
# as a worked example of a filled-in branding profile — but the kit itself is
# internal, and `npm run brand:assets` therefore only runs on a machine that has
# it. See the trademark note in README.md.
jethost-branding/

# Local screenshots used while debugging against the live install, and against
# GitHub itself. One pattern per prefix rather than a bare *.png: the skin ships
# no PNGs today, but a README screenshot is a likely addition and a blanket rule
# would silently refuse to commit it.
debug-*.png
rc-debug-*.png
gh-debug-*.png

# The same screenshots, now collected in one place instead of dropped in the
# repository root. Whole folder: it holds captures of other people's products
# (the design being matched, the live install with real mail in it), which is
# exactly the material the license above must not be read to cover.
debug/

# Third-party plugins and components kept around to read for reference — other
# projects' code under other projects' licenses. Nothing here is built or
# shipped; it is the shelf, not the skin.
examples/
example/

# Editor and agent configuration — local to whoever is working, not the project
.claude/
.vscode/
